               -- TV Lovers Transmitter --

A solution for creating a 100% free software/hardware ISDB-T transmitter, in
order to enable free speech over the electromagnetic spectrum!

For this we'll need:

- I/O boards support (A/V input) (DONE)
- A/V Encoder (DONE)
- Multiplex (DONE)
- Data inserter (DSM-CC, SI tables, ...) (DONE)
- Closed Caption encoder (WIP)
- Modulator (VHDL? GNU-Radio?) (WIP)
- RF and Power amplifier schemes (wIP)
- GUI Web (WIP)

This project contains code written by PUC-Rio/TeleMidia Lab and other
partners.


More documentation comming soon!

